<div class="panel panel-primary">
    <div class="panel-heading">Submit Data</div>
    <div class="panel-body">

% if ( $c->config->{allow_trial_submissions} ) {

        <p>If you have trials on this database that you want to submit to the production database, you can do so by either:
            <ul>
                <li>Clicking the <strong>Submit Trial</strong> button on the trial detail page of each trial you want to submit</li>
                <span style="margin: 10px 0; display: block;">OR</span>
                <li>Creating a list of multiple trials to submit and submit them all at once from the <a href="/submit/trials">Submit Multiple Trials</a> page.</li>
            </ul>
        </p>

% } else {

        <p>If you have trials on this database that you want to submit to the production database, you can:
            <ol>
                <li>Export your data from the Manage > Download Using Lists page for each data type</li>
                <li>Go to the production database at <a href="<% our $T3_PRODUCTION_URL %>"><% $T3_PRODUCTION_URL %></a> and submit your trials there.</li>
            </ol>
        </p>

% }

    </div>
</div>
